<title>USA: CCC seeks up to 50,000 T U.S. corn for North Korea.</title>
<headline>CCC seeks up to 50,000 T U.S. corn for North Korea.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Department of Agriculture said Friday it would tender on May 1 for up to 50,000 tonnes of U.S. corn for donation to North Korea.</p>
<p>The corn is slated for May 10-30 shipment.</p>
<p>((Nigel Hunt 312-408 8720))</p>
</text>
